    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been summoned to the North Pole by an unknown individual. A rebellion has begun, and it's up to you to decide the fate of the North Pole. Defeat enemies, grow your Christmas Spirit, and slay the legends of Christmas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Project Summary</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is my first solo project and will hopefully serve as a light-hearted, beginner-friendly, Christmas-themed Souls-Like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Features</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight unique enemies and bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the history of the North Pole and the Claus family lineage.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the North Pole and collect powerful weapons &amp; items.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929740/extras/71e4ffd57775f7077992492a47c81369.poster.avif?t=1753139144\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929740/extras/71e4ffd57775f7077992492a47c81369.webm?t=1753139144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929740/extras/71e4ffd57775f7077992492a47c81369.mp4?t=1753139144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929740/extras/7e68ea2be2fa657e2f2e13179c3dd59b.poster.avif?t=1753139144\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929740/extras/7e68ea2be2fa657e2f2e13179c3dd59b.webm?t=1753139144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929740/extras/7e68ea2be2fa657e2f2e13179c3dd59b.mp4?t=1753139144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen your weapons</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929740/extras/77f10a79ad4b13fe4bc9eab9a59b6912.poster.avif?t=1753139144\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929740/extras/77f10a79ad4b13fe4bc9eab9a59b6912.webm?t=1753139144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929740/extras/77f10a79ad4b13fe4bc9eab9a59b6912.mp4?t=1753139144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip powerful Ornaments, Lights, and Tree-Toppers to make the ultimate build</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929740/extras/b957cf00b7e43d776b8984b80ddf9272.poster.avif?t=1753139144\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929740/extras/b957cf00b7e43d776b8984b80ddf9272.webm?t=1753139144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929740/extras/b957cf00b7e43d776b8984b80ddf9272.mp4?t=1753139144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Roadmap:</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929740/extras/3b87bc933ebe9c37739c315b2eea921a.avif?t=1753139144\" data-has-big width=800 height=412 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been summoned to the North Pole by an unknown individual. A rebellion has begun, and it's up to you to decide the fate of the North Pole. Defeat enemies, grow your Christmas Spirit, and slay the legends of Christmas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Project Summary</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is my first solo project and will hopefully serve as a light-hearted, beginner-friendly, Christmas-themed Souls-Like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Features</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight unique enemies and bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the history of the North Pole and the Claus family lineage.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the North Pole and collect powerful weapons &amp; items.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929740/extras/71e4ffd57775f7077992492a47c81369.poster.avif?t=1753139144\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929740/extras/71e4ffd57775f7077992492a47c81369.webm?t=1753139144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929740/extras/71e4ffd57775f7077992492a47c81369.mp4?t=1753139144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929740/extras/7e68ea2be2fa657e2f2e13179c3dd59b.poster.avif?t=1753139144\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929740/extras/7e68ea2be2fa657e